    <description>Fires when AF_LostApprovalStatus__c changes to Approved — the only place StageName is set to Closed Lost. Looks up AF_LossReason__mdt for the follow-up flag, conditionally creates a CRM follow-up Task, always creates a Showroom Manager review task.

KNOWN SIMPLIFICATION: both tasks are assigned to the Opportunity Owner rather than the true Showroom Manager, since the AF_ShowroomManager__c showroom-to-manager mapping data is TBP per the LLD&apos;s own open items list.</description>
